      "name": "Scoundrel's Feint",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When the mastermind successfully Feints, the target is Off-Guard against the mastermind's melee attacks until the end of the mastermind's next turn. On a critical success, the target is off-guard against all melee attacks for that time, not just the mastermind's.",
      "rules": [
